\fs24 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 description: 
\f1\fs26 Aura combines a simple oak tabletop with a free mouth-blown glass body. Each glass form is shaped individually, resulting in organic volumes that vary in colour, proportion and surface. Light enters the glass from above and spreads through the body, revealing its changing thickness and irregularities. When switched off, the glass remains a sculptural presence; when illuminated, its form becomes visible through the light itself. The table was developed in collaboration with Nofar Zeidenshnir.
